  "note": "POC-T3 held-out (Issue #262 wave 3). mega_starmie / bad_target. Ruling unchanged; scope moved to #329.  RE-RULED 2026-08-06 (Issue #400 Phase 2): correct [2] -> [4, 5]; the holdout owner is unchanged.",
